s uncomplicated and the patient’s mother refused all prenatal testing → fever → Neonatal Functional Intestinal Obstruction\n  The pregnancy was uncomplicated and the patient’s mother refused all prenatal testing → premature birth → Meconium Ileus with Cystic Fibrosis"}
